<quiz>
  <question type="stack">
    <name>
      <text>Calculating unknown value for a logarithmic equation</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>Solve each equation for \(x\).</p>
<p><strong>(a)</strong> \(\log_{{@b@}} x = {@n@}\)</p>
<p>\(x =\) [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]]</p>
<div>[[feedback:prt1]]</div>
<p><strong>(b)</strong> \(\log_{{@b2@}} (x + {@c@}) = {@n2@}\)</p>
<p>\(x =\) [[input:ans2]] [[validation:ans2]]</p>
<div>[[feedback:prt2]]</div>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
    <generalfeedback format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<h3>Worked solution</h3>
<p>Rewrite each logarithmic equation in index form: \(\log_b y = n \Longleftrightarrow y = b^n\).</p>
<p><strong>(a)</strong> \(x = {@b@}^{@n@} = {@ta1@}\).</p>
<p><strong>(b)</strong> \(x + {@c@} = {@b2@}^{@n2@} = {@b2^n2@}\), so \(x = {@b2^n2@} - {@c@} = {@ta2@}\).</p>
<p>Check: \(x + {@c@} = {@b2^n2@} > 0\), so the logarithm is defined.</p>]]></text>
    </generalfeedback>
    <defaultgrade>1</defaultgrade>
    <penalty>0.1</penalty>
    <hidden>0</hidden>
    <idnumber/>
    <stackversion>
      <text>2026063000</text>
    </stackversion>
    <questionvariables>
      <text>n: rand([2,3]);
b: rand(sublist([2,3,4,5,10], lambda([t], t # n and not(n = 2 and t = 4))));   /* b^n, n^b and n*b all differ */
ta1: b^n;
b2: rand([2,3,4,5]);
n2: rand([2,3]);
c: 1 + rand(min(9, b2^n2 - 1) - 1 + 1);
ta2: b2^n2 - c;</text>
    </questionvariables>
    <specificfeedback format="html">
